            "created_at": "2025-07-13T18:45:11.916516+00:00",
            "notes": "[Pulsar Plus](item_4795ae1f-580d-47ec-a01d-0933cba56212) is general choice\n [Rally Ring](item_0547012b-4817-437e-aad3-aa37db93383e) good alternative if you really want to play around your ring\n\n [Solar Shielding](item_804fd8cd-78bd-46ee-a89f-20a6c9cccdcc) is super underrated item. I really recommend it to buy if you have a zarya in your team, so both of you will regenerate your shields while ring is active. Thats your second defence layer with 15% added ability damage.\n\n [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) is great with juno, you can 24/7 have full stack of its effect applied to you. For 10k you get 10% attack power, 25HP and 25% ability power. Insane value.\n\n [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is good all-rounder. Ability power, attack damage, lifesteal",
